What i did in MARK was to set the species in a column and the histry of detection and I identified the área for wich I wanted to estimate ricness.

Especies    HD            Group1  Group2

A              1001             1          0
B              1111             1          0
C              0100             1          0
D              1010             1          0
A              0001             0          1
B              1000             0          1

